{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Solar photovoltaic panels convert energy transferred by sunlight into electrical energy. They produce electricity without burning fuel during operation, but output depends on daylight, weather, location and season. Solar thermal systems are different: they use sunlight to heat water. Wind turbines use the kinetic energy of moving air to turn blades connected to a generator. They have low direct emissions during operation, but output varies with wind conditions and installations can affect landscapes and wildlife.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 32.64, "words": [["Solar", 0.102083], ["photovoltaic", 0.50575], ["panels", 1.234916], ["convert", 1.638541], ["energy", 2.08125], ["transferred", 2.497916], ["by", 2.966666], ["sunlight", 3.122916], ["into", 3.64375], ["electrical", 3.95625], ["energy.", 4.56825], ["They", 5.989583], ["produce", 6.25], ["electricity", 6.640625], ["without", 7.317708], ["burning", 7.682291], ["fuel", 7.942708], ["during", 8.255208], ["operation,", 8.502625], ["but", 9.375], ["output", 9.596375], ["depends", 10.013041], ["on", 10.390625], ["daylight,", 10.585958], ["weather,", 11.354166], ["location", 11.940125], ["and", 12.5], ["season.", 12.669291], ["Solar", 14.0625], ["thermal", 14.479166], ["systems", 14.765625], ["are", 15.221375], ["different:", 15.403666], ["they", 16.184916], ["use", 16.315125], ["sunlight", 16.510416], ["to", 16.953125], ["heat", 17.083333], ["water.", 17.33075], ["Wind", 18.645833], ["turbines", 18.945333], ["use", 19.414083], ["the", 19.596375], ["kinetic", 19.739583], ["energy", 20.234375], ["of", 20.598958], ["moving", 20.78125], ["air", 21.145833], ["to", 21.341166], ["turn", 21.510416], ["blades", 21.770833], ["connected", 22.096375], ["to", 22.539083], ["a", 22.630208], ["generator.", 22.747416], ["They", 24.244791], ["have", 24.453125], ["low", 24.6875], ["direct", 24.869791], ["emissions", 25.273458], ["during", 25.78125], ["